  "contentHtml": "<p>#열 #온도<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^<br><br>1. 아스팔트, 잔디, 메마른 흙 - 가장 뜨거운 곳은?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e269e0661643bfac702b41b21d290a654705cbe2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e269e0661643bfac702b41b21d290a654705cbe2\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"446\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아스팔트가 가장 뜨거울 것 같아도, 나름 열방출을 잘하는 구조라서 메마른 흙보다 온도가 낮다고 합니다.<br>나무를 잘 심어야겠습니다<br><br>2. 색깔별 보도 블럭의 온도는 같을까?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf64ae1da39f6483a2cd38d1ddedd805aa734911\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf64ae1da39f6483a2cd38d1ddedd805aa734911\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"878\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">보도블럭 색깔도 잘 골라야겠네요~<br><br><br>3. 아파트 놀이터에서 가장 뜨거운 곳은?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ff4331371acaa939ffb7808e9918cae4245407d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ff4331371acaa939ffb7808e9918cae4245407d\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"864\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">상위권으로는 바로 인조잔디!! <br>그러나 압도적 1등은,<br>우레탄!!<br>안전을 위해 설치했지만,<br>화상이 걱정됩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a544166f18048637be6a85a22ab12447f00d6920\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a544166f18048637be6a85a22ab12447f00d6920\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"586\"></div><p 